    title: "BAE Systems 營運的美國破產通知中心（BNC）遭遇資安事件，導致全國法院通知服務中斷",
    summary: "美國聯邦破產法院的通知中心（BNC）已連續一週無法發送通知，原因是影響了由 BAE Systems 營運的基礎設施。BNC負責處理全國所有聯邦破產法院的通知，該系統由 BAE 作為承包商為司法部門運行。由於此次資安事件，美國法院行政辦公室宣布，所有無法透過 BNC 系統和網站存取的服務均已停用。受影響的服務包括國家債權人註冊服務（National Creditor Registration Service），導致用戶無法生成用於送達文件的債權人郵件名單。法院已警告，自 10 月 9 日以來，透過該中心發出的紙本和電子通知均未送達。目前，司法部門和 BAE Systems 尚未明確說明事件的根本原因，也未確認是否有資料遭到洩露，僅表示正在調查並努力恢復系統。法院已持續接受新的案件和提交文件，但尚未提供服務恢復的預計日期。",
    tags: ["BAE Systems", "BNC", "聯邦破產法院", "資安事件", "司法系統", "服務中斷"],
    title_en: "Cybersecurity Incident Hits US Bankruptcy Court's Notice Center, Disrupting Nationwide Court Notification Services",
    summary_en: "The Bankruptcy Notice Center (BNC) for the U.S. Federal Bankruptcy Court has been unable to send notifications for a week, due to an incident affecting the infrastructure operated by BAE Systems. The BNC is responsible for processing notifications for all federal bankruptcy courts nationwide, and the system is run by BAE as a contractor for the judiciary. Due to this cybersecurity incident, the U.S. Courts Administration announced that all services inaccessible through the BNC system and website have been suspended. Affected services include the National Creditor Registration Service, preventing users from generating creditor mailing lists for service of process. The courts have warned that neither physical nor electronic notifications issued through the center since October 9th have been delivered. The judiciary and BAE Systems have not yet clarified the root cause of the incident or confirmed whether any data was leaked, stating only that they are investigating and working to restore the system. The courts continue to accept new cases and filings but have not provided an estimated date for service restoration.",
    tags_en: ["BAE Systems", "BNC", "Federal Bankruptcy Court", "Cybersecurity Incident", "Judiciary System", "Service Disruption"],
    sources: [
      { name: "SecurityWeek", url: "https://securityweek.com/bae-systems-security-incident-stalls-notices-from-us-bankruptcy-courts", lang: "EN" }
    ]
