    title: "日本漢堡王（Burger King Japan）遭資料外洩：1118萬客戶個人資料遭竊",
    summary: "全球快餐巨頭 Burger King 的日本子公司 Burger King Japan 公布，其官方智慧型手機應用程式的會員資訊管理伺服器發生了重大資料外洩事件。攻擊者在 2026 年 10 月 2 日至 10 月 7 日期間，透過未經授權的第三方存取，竊取了約 1118 萬名客戶的個人資料。受影響的資料包含姓名、出生日期、性別、電子郵件地址、電話號碼以及訂單紀錄。公司強調，受損伺服器並未儲存客戶信用卡號碼，且目前尚未發現攻擊者取得用戶憑證的證據。Burger King Japan 已向日本個人資訊保護委員會（PPC）報告此事件，並正與外部資安專家合作調查攻擊者的存取途徑。公司提醒受影響客戶警惕任何冒充 Burger King Japan 的可疑電子郵件、簡訊或電話，避免點擊連結或提供個人資訊。",
    tags: ["Burger King Japan", "資料外洩", "個人資訊", "PPC", "網路攻擊"],
    title_en: "Burger King Japan Suffers Data Breach: Personal Information of 11.18 Million Customers Stolen",
    summary_en: "Global fast-food giant Burger King's Japanese subsidiary, Burger King Japan, announced a major data breach incident affecting its official mobile application's membership information management server. Between October 2 and October 7, 2026, attackers gained unauthorized third-party access, stealing personal data belonging to approximately 11.18 million customers. The compromised data includes names, dates of birth, gender, email addresses, phone numbers, and order history. The company emphasized that the affected server did not store customer credit card numbers, and no evidence has yet been found that the attackers obtained user credentials. Burger King Japan has reported the incident to the Personal Information Protection Commission (PPC) and is currently collaborating with external cybersecurity experts to investigate the attackers' access methods. The company advises affected customers to be vigilant against any suspicious emails, SMS, or calls impersonating Burger King Japan, and to avoid clicking links or providing personal information.",
    tags_en: ["Burger King Japan", "Data Breach", "Personal Information", "PPC", "Cyberattack"],
    sources: [
      { name: "BleepingComputer", url: "https://bleepingcomputer.com/news/security/burger-king-japan-data-breach-exposes-11-million-customer-records", lang: "EN" }
    ]
