    title: "GNOME Project 發布 GNOME OS Preview，提供非開發者使用的穩定作業系統預覽版",
    summary: "GNOME Project 過去僅為開發者提供「Nightly」版本的 GNOME OS。現今，該專案宣布發布了 GNOME OS Preview，旨在提供一個更適合一般非開發者群體使用的預覽版本。GNOME OS Preview 的基礎是最新的穩定 GNOME 版本（撰寫時為 GNOME 51.1），並與 stable org.gnome.Platform Flatpak runtimes 位於同一分支。相較於 Nightly 版本，Preview 在穩定性上有了顯著提升，雖然目前僅經過有限的實際測試，但已足夠讓非開發者愛好者進行日常使用。然而，GNOME 官方指出，Preview 尚未達到完全或對廣大公眾穩定的程度，仍需實作多項功能才能宣告「準備就緒」。建議有興趣的用戶可以下載並試用 GNOME OS Preview。",
    tags: ["GNOME Project", "GNOME OS", "GNOME 51.1", "Linux", "Flatpak"],
    title_en: "GNOME Project Releases GNOME OS Preview, Offering a Stable Operating System Preview for Non-Developers",
    summary_en: "Previously, the GNOME Project only provided a 'Nightly' version of GNOME OS for developers. The project has now announced the release of GNOME OS Preview, designed to offer a preview version more suitable for general non-developer users. GNOME OS Preview is based on the latest stable GNOME version (as of writing, GNOME 51.1) and resides on the same branch as the stable org.gnome.Platform Flatpak runtimes. Compared to the Nightly version, Preview shows a significant improvement in stability. Although it has only undergone limited real-world testing, it is sufficient for non-developer enthusiasts to use for daily tasks. However, GNOME officials point out that Preview has not yet reached the level of stability required for general public use, and several features still need to be implemented before it can be declared 'ready.' Users who are interested are advised to download and try out GNOME OS Preview.",
