    category: "Linux",
    title: "NFS 網路檔案系統協議在 Linux 上的最新增強與未來發展概述",
    summary: "NFS（Network File System）是一種在類 Unix 作業系統上歷史悠久的網路檔案系統協定。在 2026 年的 Linux Plumbers Conference 上，NFS 開發人員 Jeff Layton 提供了關於 Linux 實作最新增強的全面概述。本次分享不僅涵蓋了現有的進展，也預告了未來 NFS 協議將會引入的新功能。這對於維護和開發依賴 NFS 的系統管理員和資安工程師至關重要，因為 NFS 實作持續演進，需要開發者跟上最新的標準和最佳實踐。文章指出，NFS 協議本身仍在不斷發展，開發者需要持續關注這些核心元件的更新。",
    tags: ["NFS", "Linux", "Linux Plumbers Conference", "網路檔案系統", "Jeff Layton"],
    title_en: "Overview of Latest Enhancements and Future Development of the NFS Network File System Protocol on Linux",
    summary_en: "NFS (Network File System) is a long-standing network file system protocol used on Unix-like operating systems. At the 2026 Linux Plumbers Conference, NFS developer Jeff Layton provided a comprehensive overview of the latest enhancements to the Linux implementation. This presentation covered not only existing progress but also previewed new features that the NFS protocol will introduce in the future. This is crucial for system administrators and security engineers who maintain and develop NFS-dependent systems, as the NFS implementation continues to evolve, requiring developers to keep up with the latest standards and best practices. The article notes that the NFS protocol itself is continuously developing, and developers must stay informed about the updates to these core components.",
    tags_en: ["NFS", "Linux", "Linux Plumbers Conference", "Network File System", "Jeff Layton"],
    sources: [
      { name: "LWN.net", url: "https://lwn.net/Articles/1098611", lang: "EN" }
    ]
