    category: "Linux",
    title: "多發行版安全更新公告：AlmaLinux、Debian、Mageia、Oracle、Red Hat與Ubuntu修補多個核心與應用程式元件",
    summary: "多數主流 Linux 發行版，包括 AlmaLinux、Debian、Mageia、Oracle、Red Hat 和 Ubuntu，近期發布了廣泛的安全性更新。這些更新涵蓋了從核心元件到上層應用程式的各個層面，涉及的元件包括 ghostscript、grafana、hplip、libsoup3、wireshark、chromium、cifs-utils、expat、gstreamer 插件、jpeg-xl、mutt、以及各種 Python 函式庫和 Java 堆棧等。各發行版針對不同組件進行了修補，例如 Oracle 更新了 kernel、libsoup、rpcbind 和 wireshark；Red Hat 更新了 openssh、php8 和多個 Python 相關套件；而 Ubuntu 則更新了 golang-1.23、linux-azure 和 rabbitmq-server。這些更新反映了 Linux 生態系統對廣泛元件的持續維護與安全加固，建議使用者應根據發行版官方公告，及時更新所有受影響的套件，以確保系統的穩定性與安全性。",
    tags: ["AlmaLinux", "Debian", "Mageia", "Oracle", "Red Hat", "Ubuntu", "Linux 核心", "安全更新"],
    title_en: "Multi-Vendor Security Update Announcement: AlmaLinux, Debian, Mageia, Oracle, Red Hat, and Ubuntu Patch Multiple Kernel and Application Components",
    summary_en: "Multiple mainstream Linux distributions, including AlmaLinux, Debian, Mageia, Oracle, Red Hat, and Ubuntu, have recently released extensive security updates. These updates cover various layers, from core kernel components to higher-level applications, affecting components such as ghostscript, grafana, hplip, libsoup3, wireshark, chromium, cifs-utils, expat, gstreamer plugins, jpeg-xl, mutt, and various Python libraries and Java stacks. Each distribution has patched different components; for example, Oracle updated the kernel, libsoup, rpcbind, and wireshark; Red Hat updated openssh, php8, and multiple Python-related packages; while Ubuntu updated golang-1.23, linux-azure, and rabbitmq-server. These updates reflect the continuous maintenance and security hardening of the Linux ecosystem for a wide range of components. Users are advised to update all affected packages promptly, following the official announcements of their respective distributions, to ensure system stability and security.",
    tags_en: ["AlmaLinux", "Debian", "Mageia", "Oracle", "Red Hat", "Ubuntu", "Linux Kernel", "Security Update"],
    sources: [
      { name: "LWN.net", url: "https://lwn.net/Articles/1101015", lang: "EN" }
    ]
