    title: "GNOME OS 宣布 Preview 版本，邁向穩定發行，整合最新 GNOME 51.1 組件",
    summary: "GNOME OS Linux 發行版宣布推出 Preview 版本，標誌著其從僅為夜間測試（Nightly）工件，轉向成為面向一般終端用戶的通用作業系統。開發團隊正積極將 GNOME OS 提升至更穩定的狀態，而非僅限於測試環境。本次 Preview 版本目前追蹤最新的 GNOME 51.1 組件。GNOME OS 在系統層面持續進行重大增強，特別是在 systemd-homed 和 systemd-sysupdate 等現代技術功能的整合，提升了其對廣大用戶群的吸引力。開發者已將其定位為一個成熟的、可供一般使用者使用的作業系統。用戶可以從 os.gnome.org 下載 GNOME OS Preview 和 Nightly ISO 進行試用。",
    tags: ["GNOME OS", "Linux", "GNOME 51.1", "systemd-homed", "系統更新", "作業系統"],
    title_en: "GNOME OS Announces Preview Version, Moving Towards Stable Release with Latest GNOME 51.1 Components",
    summary_en: "The GNOME OS Linux distribution has announced the release of a Preview version, marking its transition from being solely a Nightly build artifact to a general-purpose operating system for end-users. The development team is actively working to elevate GNOME OS to a more stable state, moving beyond a purely testing environment. This Preview version currently tracks the latest GNOME 51.1 components. GNOME OS continues to undergo significant system-level enhancements, particularly the integration of modern technical features such as systemd-homed and systemd-sysupdate, increasing its appeal to a wider user base. Developers have positioned it as a mature operating system ready for general use. Users can download both the GNOME OS Preview and Nightly ISO from os.gnome.org for testing.",
