    trackers: ["os"],
    category: "Linux",
    title: "資深 Linux 核心開發者 Darrick Wong 宣布暫時退居幕後",
    summary: "資深 Linux 核心工程師 Darrick Wong 在過去 23 年參與 Linux 核心開發後，宣布暫時從多個核心開發角色退下。他於 Linux Git 樹的 Linux 7.3 版本中提交了一筆變更，正式移除自己作為 IOmap 文件系統程式碼審核員的職責。這標誌著他在卸任 XFS 文件系統維護者之後，正式結束了他在 Linux 核心開發領域的正式職責。Darrick Wong 提到，他在 Oracle 工作了 14 年，並總共投入了 23 年時間於 Linux 核心開發。這項變動主要屬於開發人員的職涯規劃，對一般使用者或企業的實務操作影響甚微，但代表了 Linux 核心維護團隊的變動。",
    tags: ["Linux 核心", "Darrick Wong", "XFS", "IOmap", "Linux 7.3"],
    title_en: "Senior Linux Kernel Developer Darrick Wong Announces Temporary Retirement",
    summary_en: "After 23 years contributing to Linux kernel development, senior Linux kernel engineer Darrick Wong has announced his temporary stepping down from multiple core development roles. He submitted a change to the Linux 7.3 version of the Linux Git tree, formally removing his role as the IOmap file system code reviewer. This marks the formal conclusion of his official responsibilities in Linux kernel development, following his tenure as the XFS file system maintainer. Darrick Wong noted that he worked at Oracle for 14 years and has dedicated a total of 23 years to Linux kernel development. While this change primarily reflects a developer's career planning, having minimal impact on general users or enterprise operations, it does signify a shift within the Linux kernel maintenance team.",
