    title: "Intel Xeon 6980P Granite Rapids 伺服器平台在 Ubuntu 26.10 上進行效能評測",
    summary: "本文針對 Intel Xeon 6980P 處理器搭載的 Granite Rapids 伺服器平台，追蹤其在過去一年間於 Linux 系統上的效能演進。測試環境從先前的 Ubuntu 25.10 升級至最新的 Ubuntu 26.10。本次評測的 Ubuntu 26.10 版本包含了 Linux 7.3 核心，整合了過去一年的核心優化，並預設使用 GCC 15.3 等多項軟體更新。測試硬體配置為 Gigabyte R284-A92-AAL1 伺服器，搭配兩顆 Intel Xeon 6980P 處理器、24 個 Micron MRDIMM-8800 記憶體，以及 1.5TB KIOXIA KCD8XPUG1T92 NVMe SSD。文章旨在比較不同 Ubuntu 版本下，該伺服器平台在 Linux 核心層面和整體軟體堆疊的效能變化。",
    tags: ["Intel Xeon 6980P", "Granite Rapids", "Ubuntu 26.10", "Linux 7.3", "Phoronix", "伺服器效能"],
    title_en: "Intel Xeon 6980P Granite Rapids Server Platform Performance Evaluation on Ubuntu 26.10",
    summary_en: "This article tracks the performance evolution of the Granite Rapids server platform, powered by the Intel Xeon 6980P processor, on Linux systems over the past year. The testing environment was upgraded from the previous Ubuntu 25.10 to the latest Ubuntu 26.10. This Ubuntu 26.10 version incorporates the Linux 7.3 kernel, integrating core optimizations from the past year, and defaults to software updates such as GCC 15.3. The test hardware configuration includes a Gigabyte R284-A92-AAL1 server, equipped with two Intel Xeon 6980P processors, 24 Micron MRDIMM-8800 memory modules, and a 1.5TB KIOXIA KCD8XPUG1T92 NVMe SSD. The article aims to compare the performance changes of this server platform, at both the Linux kernel level and the overall software stack, across different Ubuntu versions.",
