    category: "Linux",
    title: "Mesa Zink 驅動程式新增 VA-API 支援，實現 Vulkan 上的視訊加速功能",
    summary: "Mesa 專案已將 Zink Gallium3D 驅動程式的初步視訊加速支援合併進來，該功能允許在 Vulkan Video 介面之上暴露 Video Acceleration API (VA-API) 的實作。這項功能預計在 Mesa 27.0（預計於 Q1）中可用，將使 Vulkan Video 能夠被目標通用 Linux VA-API 介面的應用程式利用。此專案由 Valve 的 Mike Blumenkrantz 和 Red Hat 的 David Airlie 等人多年來推動。目前此 Zink 視訊加速實作僅支援 H.264 視訊解碼，尚未支援其他格式。目前大部分測試已在 Radeon RADV 驅動程式上進行。開發團隊目前正在開發 H.265 和 AV1 視訊加速程式碼，但尚未合併。開發者可透過 Mesa 的合併請求了解更多細節。",
    tags: ["Mesa", "Zink", "VA-API", "Vulkan", "Linux", "H.264"],
    title_en: "Mesa Zink Driver Adds VA-API Support, Enabling Video Acceleration on Vulkan",
    summary_en: "The Mesa project has merged preliminary video acceleration support for the Zink Gallium3D driver. This feature allows the implementation of the Video Acceleration API (VA-API) to be exposed over the Vulkan Video interface. This functionality is expected to be available in Mesa 27.0 (anticipated in Q1), enabling applications targeting the generic Linux VA-API interface to utilize Vulkan Video. This project has been driven by individuals such as Valve's Mike Blumenkrantz and Red Hat's David Airlie over several years. Currently, this Zink video acceleration implementation only supports H.264 video decoding and does not support other formats. Most testing has been conducted on the Radeon RADV driver. The development team is currently developing H.265 and AV1 video acceleration code, but this has not yet been merged. Developers can find more details via Mesa's merge requests.",
    tags_en: ["Mesa", "Zink", "VA-API", "Vulkan", "Linux", "H.264"],
    sources: [
      { name: "Phoronix", url: "https://phoronix.com/news/Mesa-Zink-VA-API-On-Vulkan", lang: "EN" }
    ]
