    title: "Fedora 45 發布延期：因缺乏候選媒體，原定日期推遲至下週",
    summary: "Fedora 45 的發布原定目標日期為 10 月 20 日，並設有備用日期，包括 10 月 27 日和 11 月 3 日。然而，由於未能及時發布出候選（release candidate）媒體，原定的發布日期已被宣布為「不可行」（NO-GO）。因此，發布時間至少推遲到下週，具體日期將取決於是否有任何阻礙性 Bug 的修復。儘管延期，Fedora 45 仍預計是一次令人期待的發行，其主要亮點包括過渡到 KMSCON 支援 VT console、整合 GNOME 51 桌面元件、實現可重現的套件建構（reproducible package builds）、以及 DRM Panic 前端等多項重大更新。開發者已在 fedora-devel 名單上確認了此次延期。",
    tags: ["Fedora 45", "Linux", "GNOME 51", "KMSCON", "可重現套件"],
    title_en: "Fedora 45 Release Delayed: Original Date Postponed Due to Lack of Release Candidate Media",
    summary_en: "The originally targeted release date for Fedora 45 was October 20, with backup dates set for October 27 and November 3. However, due to the inability to release release candidate media in a timely manner, the original release date has been declared a 'NO-GO.' Consequently, the release is postponed by at least one week, with the specific date depending on the resolution of any blocking bugs. Despite the delay, Fedora 45 is expected to be an exciting release, featuring major updates including the transition to KMSCON support for VT console, integration of GNOME 51 desktop components, implementation of reproducible package builds, and the DRM Panic frontend. Developers have confirmed this delay on the fedora-devel mailing list.",
