    title: "BeyondTrust Remote Support遭零日漏洞攻擊：Mandiant揭露「Armory Castle」竊取內部憑證",
    summary: "資安研究公司Mandiant指出，一個由中國背景的駭客組織「Armory Castle」（前身為UNC5221）利用BeyondTrust Remote Support的關鍵零日漏洞（CVE-2026-102764）進行了大規模網路攻擊。該漏洞源於內部訊息元件未正確驗證傳入訊息的來源，CVSS評分為9.3。攻擊者利用此漏洞後，成功進入系統，並系統性地搜尋了內建的密鑰管理資料庫，竊取了多個應用程式API金鑰和管理員憑證。駭客還建立持久性存取權，刪除系統和Web伺服器日誌，並升級權限，最終能夠執行內部網路偵察，並外傳受害者桌面上的敏感文件。BeyondTrust已於10月9日發布了修補程式，建議所有使用本機部署（on-prem）的組織應立即更新，並嚴格限制其對外網的暴露。此外，建議實施網路隔離、部署Web Application Firewall (WAF)等補償性控制措施。",
    tags: ["BeyondTrust", "CVE-2026-102764", "Remote Support", "Mandiant", "零日漏洞"],
    title_en: "BeyondTrust Remote Support Targeted by Zero-Day Vulnerability: Mandiant Reveals 'Armory Castle' Theft of Internal Credentials",
    summary_en: "Security research firm Mandiant reported that a sophisticated threat actor group with Chinese origins, 'Armory Castle' (formerly UNC5221), exploited a critical zero-day vulnerability (CVE-2026-102764) in BeyondTrust Remote Support to conduct a large-scale cyberattack. The vulnerability stems from the internal messaging component failing to properly validate the source of incoming messages, resulting in a CVSS score of 9.3. After exploiting this flaw, the attackers gained system access and systematically searched the built-in key management database, stealing multiple application API keys and administrator credentials. The threat actors also established persistent access, deleted system and web server logs, and escalated privileges, ultimately enabling internal network reconnaissance and exfiltration of sensitive files from the victim's desktop. BeyondTrust released a patch on October 9th, advising all organizations using the on-premise deployed version to update immediately and strictly limit its exposure to the public internet. Furthermore, implementing compensating controls such as network segmentation and deploying a Web Application Firewall (WAF) is recommended.",
    tags_en: ["BeyondTrust", "CVE-2026-102764", "Remote Support", "Mandiant", "Zero-Day Vulnerability"],
    sources: [
      { name: "Dark Reading", url: "https://darkreading.com/endpoint-security/beyondtrust-remote-support-exploited-edge-bugs", lang: "EN" }
    ]
