    category: "重點關注",
    title: "三星Galaxy S27系列可能因散熱問題，考慮改用Exynos替代Snapdragon晶片",
    summary: "根據一份報導指出，三星Galaxy S27系列可能不會使用最新的Snapdragon晶片，而是考慮改用Exynos晶片。此前，Snapdragon與Exynos的晶片選擇爭議已持續多年，過去三星曾因高通晶片散熱問題，在十多年前的Galaxy S6上曾全數採用Exynos。據《首爾經濟日報》報導，三星已向高通提出Snapdragon 8 Elite Extreme Gen 6晶片散熱問題，並將Exynos 2700作為替代方案。報導稱，三星正在與高通協商解決散熱問題，若高通無法達到所需性能，三星將考慮Exynos 2700，權衡性能穩定性與大規模生產時程。高通最新旗艦晶片Elite Extreme Gen 6採用2nm製程，宣稱相較Gen 5晶片提升了CPU和GPU性能，但高通隨後發布聲明否認了散熱問題的報導，並表示其下一代旗艦平台具備創新和強勁動能。目前，市場上已有搭載該晶片的機型如Motorola Signature 27，但散熱問題是否普遍仍待觀察。",
    tags: ["Samsung", "Galaxy S27", "Snapdragon", "Exynos", "Qualcomm", "散熱問題"],
    title_en: "Samsung Galaxy S27 Series May Consider Exynos Chip to Address Thermal Issues with Snapdragon",
    summary_en: "According to a report, the Samsung Galaxy S27 series may not use the latest Snapdragon chip, but instead may consider switching to the Exynos chip. The debate over chip selection between Snapdragon and Exynos has persisted for years; in the past, Samsung fully adopted Exynos in the Galaxy S6 over a decade ago due to thermal issues with Qualcomm chips. According to the Seoul Economic Daily, Samsung has raised thermal concerns regarding the Snapdragon 8 Elite Extreme Gen 6 chip with Qualcomm, proposing Exynos 2700 as an alternative. The report states that Samsung is negotiating with Qualcomm to resolve the thermal issues, and if Qualcomm cannot meet the required performance, Samsung will consider Exynos 2700, balancing performance stability with large-scale production timelines. Qualcomm's latest flagship chip, Elite Extreme Gen 6, utilizes a 2nm process and claims to improve CPU and GPU performance compared to the Gen 5 chip. However, Qualcomm later issued a statement denying the thermal issues report, asserting that its next-generation flagship platform possesses innovation and strong momentum. Currently, models equipped with this chip, such as the Motorola Signature 27, are available in the market, but whether the thermal issues are widespread remains to be seen.",
    tags_en: ["Samsung", "Galaxy S27", "Snapdragon", "Exynos", "Qualcomm", "Thermal Issues"],
