    title: "Google One AI Pro 試用版限制曝光：用戶在免費試用期內無法享有完整服務權益",
    summary: "Google One AI Pro 是一項每月 $19.99 的訂閱服務，提供擴展的 Gemini 使用額度、5TB 雲端儲存空間，並包含 Google Home Premium、Health Premium 和 YouTube Premium Lite 等多項服務。然而，文章指出，當用戶透過購買 Pixel 11 或其他產品獲得的 AI Pro 免費試用期，其權益與已付費訂閱用戶存在顯著差異，且此限制並未在註冊時充分揭露。\n具體限制包括：在 Antigravity 開發工具中，試用版無法使用 Gemini 4 Argon 模型；此外，YouTube Premium Lite 服務也必須等到用戶開始付費後才能啟用。另一個損失是 Google One 提供的 Google Store 10% 返點優惠在試用期內無法使用。儘管 Google 的支援文件有提及部分限制，但文章認為其在註冊或廣告宣傳時的揭露程度不足，導致用戶產生誤解。Google 提供了多種形式的免費試用，例如購買 Pixel 11 可享 6 個月免費試用。",
    tags: ["Google One", "AI Pro", "Gemini", "Pixel 11", "YouTube Premium Lite", "訂閱服務"],
    title_en: "Google One AI Pro Trial Limitations Exposed: Users Cannot Access Full Service Benefits During Free Trial Period",
    summary_en: "Google One AI Pro is a subscription service priced at $19.99 per month, offering expanded Gemini usage credits, 5TB of cloud storage, and multiple services including Google Home Premium, Health Premium, and YouTube Premium Lite. However, the article points out that the benefits associated with the AI Pro free trial, obtained by purchasing a Pixel 11 or other products, differ significantly from those of paid subscribers, and these limitations were not fully disclosed during registration. Specific limitations include: the trial version cannot use the Gemini 4 Argon model within the Antigravity development tool; furthermore, the YouTube Premium Lite service must wait until the user begins paying to be activated. Another loss is the inability to use the 10% Google Store cashback benefit provided by Google One during the trial period. Although Google's support documentation mentions some limitations, the article argues that the level of disclosure during registration or advertising is insufficient, leading to user misunderstanding. Google offers various forms of free trials, such as a 6-month free trial upon purchasing a Pixel 11.",
    tags_en: ["Google One", "AI Pro", "Gemini", "Pixel 11", "YouTube Premium Lite", "Subscription Service"],
