    title: "LLVMpipe 軟體驅動程式透過 AI 技術支援 AVX-512，提升圖形運算效能",
    summary: "Mesa 的 LLVMpipe 軟體驅動程式，目前已透過一個草稿合併請求（draft merge request）新增了對片段著色器（fragment shaders）的 512 位元向量支援。此項功能旨在提升在支援 AVX-512 的現代系統上的圖形運算效能。此概念最初由 Red Hat 工程師 David Airlie 多年前提出，但尚未完成。近期，開發者利用 GPT Terra 和 Astra 等 AI 模型，成功完成了剩餘的程式碼填補和錯誤修復。David Airlie 表示，AI 在此過程中幫助彌補了程式碼的最後空缺並發現了錯誤。目前該功能仍處於草稿階段，開發者尚未能在支援 AVX-512 的硬體上進行實際測試。此更新對於需要高效能 CPU 進行圖形渲染的應用程式具有實質意義，預計將提升 Gallium3D/OpenGL 驅動的運算能力。",
    tags: ["LLVMpipe", "Mesa", "AVX-512", "OpenGL", "AI", "CPU 驅動程式"],
    title_en: "LLVMpipe Software Driver Uses AI to Support AVX-512, Boosting Graphics Computing Performance",
    summary_en: "Mesa's LLVMpipe software driver has added support for 512-bit vectors for fragment shaders via a draft merge request. This feature aims to enhance graphics computing performance on modern systems that support AVX-512. The concept was originally proposed by Red Hat engineer David Airlie years ago but remained incomplete. Recently, developers successfully completed the remaining code filling and bug fixing using AI models such as GPT Terra and Astra. David Airlie stated that AI helped fill the final gaps in the code and discover errors during this process. The feature is currently still in draft status, and developers have not yet been able to test it on hardware supporting AVX-512. This update is significant for applications requiring high-performance CPU for graphics rendering, and is expected to boost the computational capabilities of the Gallium3D/OpenGL driver.",
    tags_en: ["LLVMpipe", "Mesa", "AVX-512", "OpenGL", "AI", "CPU Driver"],
