    category: "重點關注",
    title: "Intel發布LLM-Scaler-vLLM PV 1.5，大幅升級支援Arc Graphics加速AI模型運算",
    summary: "Intel軟體工程師發布了LLM-Scaler-vLLM PV 1.5，這是一個基於容器化Docker堆疊的解決方案，旨在利用Intel Arc Graphics硬體提供便捷的AI/LLM運算體驗。本次升級是為在Crescent Island Intel GPU D Series推出前，提升Arc Graphics的應用能力。本次版本從vLLM 0.14大幅躍升至vLLM 0.26，同時PyTorch版本也從v2.10升級至v2.12。功能方面，支援的LLM模型範圍擴大，新增了Qwen系列（如Qwen3.6-27B、Qwen3.8-27B、Qwen3.6-35B-A3B）和更多Gemma模型（如gemma-4-26B-A4B-it、gemma-4-31B-it）的支援。此外，系統現已支援線上FP8和對稱INT4量化，並增加了FP8 KV cache的支援。效能方面，Intel軟體堆疊提升了Qwen和Gemma 4模型的首次生成時間（time-to-first-token），並改善了MTP解碼、LoRA服務和FP8 KV cache的性能。此版本包含多項錯誤修復，可透過GitHub獲取。",
    tags: ["Intel", "LLM", "vLLM", "Arc Graphics", "PyTorch", "AI運算"],
    title_en: "Intel Releases LLM-Scaler-vLLM PV 1.5, Significantly Upgrading Support for Arc Graphics AI Model Computing",
    summary_en: "Intel software engineers have released LLM-Scaler-vLLM PV 1.5, a solution built on a containerized Docker stack designed to provide an accessible AI/LLM computing experience utilizing Intel Arc Graphics hardware. This upgrade aims to enhance the application capabilities of Arc Graphics ahead of the release of the Crescent Island Intel GPU D Series. This version represents a significant jump from vLLM 0.14 to vLLM 0.26, while the PyTorch version is also upgraded from v2.10 to v2.12. Functionally, the supported LLM model range has expanded, adding support for the Qwen series (such as Qwen3.6-27B, Qwen3.8-27B, Qwen3.6-35B-A3B) and more Gemma models (such as gemma-4-26B-A4B-it, gemma-4-31B-it). Furthermore, the system now supports online FP8 and symmetric INT4 quantization, and includes support for FP8 KV cache. In terms of performance, the Intel software stack has improved the time-to-first-token for Qwen and Gemma 4 models, and enhanced the performance of MTP decoding, LoRA serving, and FP8 KV cache. This version includes multiple bug fixes and is available via GitHub.",
